Young and Loud sez:

>         Hmm... perhaps this is standard investment-trader stuff (hey, I'm a
> math geek!  Anyone wanna give a reference so I can actually claim to know
> something?) but I'm wondering if anyone can make speculations upon what
> markets will look like *after* a trader starts making decisions which are
